Spec: Independent native SDK acceptance

Purpose:
  Verify a real Binder descriptor and application-owned socket across different Android UIDs and signatures.

Owns:
  ./NativeConsumerTest.java

Must:
  Reject a wrong Agent signer before binding and retain the approved application reference across test processes.
  Verify local authorization refusal, large transfer hash and true request FIN, one-use attachment and active revocation.
  Use explicit operation UUIDs without automatic mutation replay and report only non-secret evidence.
